        <mxCell id="c158" value="Combined fragment" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" parent="c144" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="466" y="64" width="144" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c159" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;Guard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; admits each call, enforces the call kind’s budget (sniff 5 s, import 120 s, transform 250 ms per record, hook 5 s …) and turns panics into errors attributed to the plugin. After &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;QUARANTINE_AFTER&lt;/span&gt; = 3 panics or overruns the plugin is quarantined until &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;Health::reset&lt;/span&gt;. Remote calls get 0.9 × budget; a crashed host is restarted lazily (at most 3 crashes in 10 min). The host watches each process’s memory, and installed third-party plugins (signed &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;.imtplugin&lt;/span&gt; packages, ADR 0027) join the same list. Safe mode installs nothing and uses the built-in profile." style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#8A93A6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2130;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="2454" width="1020" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c160" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#5A6375&quot;&gt;IMT · updated 2026-10-22&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;align=right;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="2594" width="220" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
